Bundled fonts
apps/server/fonts holds Oswald (Oswald.woff2) and Inter (Inter-Regular.woff2, Inter-SemiBold.woff2), Latin subsets taken from the npm
packages @fontsource/oswald and @fontsource/inter 5.3.0. They are copied into the container image so a report's look can name them.
Both are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1:
  Oswald: Copyright 2016 The Oswald Project Authors (https://github.com/googlefonts/OswaldFont)
  Inter: Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter)
The licence texts are apps/server/fonts/OFL-Oswald.txt and apps/server/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt, and apps/server/fonts/SOURCES.txt records the
source packages and file checksums. Keep each licence file with its font. A build can also embed fonts an agency supplies in its own brand
folder (apps/viewer/brand/README.md); those fonts are not part of this repository and keep their own licences.

Dependencies
The runtime dependencies are react and react-dom (MIT), three (MIT) and lucide-react (ISC). Build and test tools are vite, esbuild and
@vitejs/plugin-react (MIT) and typescript (Apache-2.0). package-lock.json lists every installed package with its licence field.
